# - `conversation.created`: A conversation was scheduled, or opened by an incoming call or message. - `conversation.started`: The contact engaged: answered a call (a person, not a voicemail) or wrote back. - `conversation.transferred`: The agent handed the call to a person; `transfer.summary` says what was talked about. - `conversation.ended`: The conversation ended, with its `outcome` (or `null`), its length and its cost. - `conversation.no_reply`: Every channel was tried and the contact did not engage. - `conversation.cancelled`: You cancelled the conversation. - `conversation.failed`: The conversation could not go on: the balance did not cover it, or no channel could be used. - `message.sent`: A call was placed, or an SMS, WhatsApp message or email left Yesly. - `message.delivered`: The carrier, WhatsApp or the mail server confirmed delivery. - `message.failed`: It could not be sent or delivered; the conversation moves to its next channel. - `message.received`: The contact wrote: an SMS, a WhatsApp message or an email. - `contact.created`: A contact was created, by you or by an incoming call or message. - `contact.updated`: A contact's name, language, identifiers or metadata changed. - `contact.merged`: Another contact was merged into this one; `merged_contact` is the id that went away. - `contact.erased`: Everything about the contact was deleted (except its opt-outs). - `contact.opted_out`: An address opted out of a channel: the contact wrote BAJA, an email bounced or was reported, or you added it. - `contact.opted_in`: An opt-out was removed: the contact wrote ALTA, or you deleted it. - `agent.deployed`: A new version of an agent reached `live`. - `balance.low`: The balance went below your alert threshold. - `balance.topped_up`: A top-up was paid.
EventType = Literal["conversation.created", "conversation.started", "conversation.transferred", "conversation.ended", "conversation.no_reply", "conversation.cancelled", "conversation.failed", "message.sent", "message.delivered", "message.failed", "message.received", "contact.created", "contact.updated", "contact.merged", "contact.erased", "contact.opted_out", "contact.opted_in", "agent.deployed", "balance.low", "balance.topped_up"]


